#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD9703 expect=violation domain=TS
# Rule:Description: FDA-SD9703 — the Required key TSPARMCD is not populated.
#note "TSPARMCD blank -> violation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of TSPARMCD."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TS
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col TSSEQ type=Char
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSPARM type=Char
col TSVAL type=Char
---
S1      | TS     | 1     |          | Trial Title | A Study
---
